OL,3,GNEWSA'Influential' zoo welfare
OL,4,Astandards pioneer dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to the
OL,7,F"influential" owner of a wildlife park
OL,8,Fwho colleagues said had helped shape
OL,9,Fthe rules and regulations governing
OL,10,Fzoos.
OL,12,FKen Sims founded Thrigby Hall, in
OL,13,FNorfolk, in 1979 and has died at the
OL,14,Fage of 85.
OL,16,FThe zoo's director, Scott Bird, who
OL,17,Fknew him for more than two decades,
OL,18,Fsaid he was always keen to help zoos
OL,19,Fprogress and improve.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
